  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommonly used in business, government policy, and employment contexts. Often appears in discussions of tax benefits, employee benefits, and social welfare programs.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {優遇|ゆうぐう}する (to give preferential treatment)\n- {優遇|ゆうぐう}{措置|そち} (preferential measures)\n- {優遇|ゆうぐう}{税制|ぜいせい} (preferential tax system)\n- {優遇|ゆうぐう}{金利|きんり} (preferential interest rate)\n\nCONTRAST:\n- {冷遇|れいぐう}: cold treatment, neglect — the opposite of {優遇|ゆうぐう}",
